{"version":1,"content":"<p>一項最新研究顯示，2024年襲擊地球的強烈太陽超級風暴不僅擾亂了近地空間環境，還將原本受到保護的地球周邊區域臨時轉變成了一座天然粒子加速器，使高能電子在其中被迅速加速到接近光速，其能量甚至足以穿透部分衞星防護層。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/science/1585654.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:23.364558+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":111,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-09T17:26:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T12:33:58.536548+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:47.084728+00:00","content_hash":"28a2e8fab68fe0db68870ffa34db1a252ae4ff80c0617861b74f3bf303caf710","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}